  "body": "Set aside previous price expectations and take a fresh look at 9 Penzance Road. Our vendors are motivated to move. View the home, appreciate the quality and lifestyle on offer, and put your best offer forward.\r\n\r\nSingle Level Luxury In Prime Mairangi Bay. Offering the ease of single-level living in one of the North Shore's most sought-after coastal locations, this is a home that perfectly balances quality, comfort and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Mairangi Bay, just moments from the beach, village, cafes and some of Auckland's most sought-after school zones, this home will appeal to two very different buyers for exactly the same reason - lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFor families, it's the opportunity to secure a beautifully presented home in a tightly held coastal community, where children can walk to excellent local schools, spend weekends at the beach and enjoy everything that makes the East Coast Bays such a desirable place to grow up.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to downsize, it's the chance to remain in a premium location without compromising on quality, comfort or entertaining space. Every detail has already been taken care of, allowing you to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe current owners have invested extensively in the property, creating a home that feels both luxurious and incredibly practical. The seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to an exceptional all-season entertaining area featuring a louvre roof system with glass sliders, electric blinds, outdoor heaters and ambient lighting.\r\n\r\nThe attention to detail continues throughout the home with custom cabinetry, designer lighting, plantation shutters, ceiling speakers and premium finishes rarely found in homes of this size. Outside, a heated saltwater pool and Hot Spring spa provide a private retreat, while beautifully illuminated gardens create a stunning setting both day and night.\r\n\r\nModern conveniences include a substantial solar power system with battery storage, EV charging, an automated entry gate and a fully upgraded garage, ensuring the home is as functional as it is beautiful.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a family prioritising education and lifestyle, or a discerning buyer looking to downsize into one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs, 9 Penzance Road offers a rare combination of location, quality and effortless living.\r\n\r\nThis is a home where the hard work has already been done. All that's left to do is enjoy it.",
